WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 4 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:06.970
A little bag of bones taking on three beast mates at once?

2
00:00:06.970 --> 00:00:08.610
Oh my god, this is priceless.

3
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.210
Trash belongs with Trash.

4
00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:13.930
Let these three worthless beasts escort this half-dead relic straight to her grave.

5
00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:15.730
Honestly, it's a match made in hell.

6
00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:45.220
The bond is complete. You're my beast mates now.

7
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.940
Let's get out of here.

8
00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:50.940
Congratulations, Sylvia. Three beast mates successfully barred.

9
00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.420
Displaying current affinity points now.

10
00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.620
Warning. Please increase your beast mate's affinity points as soon as possible.

11
00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.220
Otherwise, your body will rapidly deteriorate and die.

12
00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:04.860
Got it. I need to make these boys love me and I need to do it fast.

13
00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:16.030
My life literally depends on it.

14
00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:17.470
What's the rush, Grandma?

15
00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:19.790
Eager to plan your own funeral?

16
00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:21.470
Move.

17
00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:26.070
Or are you just that desperate to get home so your three beast mates can service you?

18
00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.830
With that frail little body?

19
00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:29.590
Are you sure you can even survive them?

20
00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:31.670
I said get out of my way.

21
00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:35.110
Who the hell do you think you're talking to?

22
00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:47.010
Bruno! Jesus, the craig's some manners!

23
00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:48.930
Go ahead and see what happens.

24
00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.690
She's just a useless old crone!

25
00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.610
Why are you protecting her?

26
00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:58.250
Useless or not, she's my wife.

27
00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:00.170
Back off, you stupid mutt.

28
00:02:00.170 --> 00:02:02.970
Bruno! You're an A-tier beast folk!

29
00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.410
How can you let some F-tier trash humiliate you like this?

30
00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:10.240
Knock him down!

31
00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:12.760
Wait. This black wolf was half-dead in the arena.

32
00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.560
Why does he feel completely different now?

33
00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.480
This is out of line! Bruno!

34
00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.800
Rip that black wolf's damn hand off!

35
00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:33.830
Imperial law and bring my mates home, but my sister...

36
00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:38.830
Rosie is ordering her beast to murder me in the halls!

37
00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:41.470
The heavens already cursed me with this dying body.

38
00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:44.790
And now my own sister wants me dead.

39
00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.910
How could you be so cruel?

40
00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:50.230
Old witch, you've got some tricks.

41
00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:54.150
Just wait. Cassie and I are going to make you pay.

42
00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:59.260
Stop embarrassing yourself, Bruno. We're leaving.

43
00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.580
She's weak, but she's got brains.

44
00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.140
Played that crowd like a fiddle.

45
00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.620
Maybe I underestimated her.

46
00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.540
She seems really reliable.

47
00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.380
I really am lucky she picked me.

48
00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:12.580
I knew she wasn't simple.

49
00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:15.820
This is obviously an imperial trap to expose my true identity.

50
00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:18.300
I won't fall for it.

51
00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:21.020
Seriously? Minus ten?

52
00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:24.500
What's wrong with this Alistair guy?

53
00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:29.170
All right, my three lovely husbands.

54
00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:30.690
Let's go home.
